            </div>
            <div class="fw-bold fs-5 text-dark mb-1">Giặt ủi</div>
            <div class="text-muted small mb-3">Dịch vụ giặt ủi chuyên nghiệp</div>
            <div class="fw-bold fs-4 text-dark mb-3">50.000 đ <span class="text-muted fs-6 fw-normal">/ Kg</span></div>
            <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
